    "description": "<p>Sweeps a bloody scythe through up to three adjacent enemies, dealing 3d8 + {{math spellPower \"*\" 3}} damage and applying one Bleeding to each.</p><p>The caster tests Will + {{math spellPower \"*\" 3}} against each target's Strength.</p><p><strong>On success:</strong> the target is pushed back one hex.</p><p>Half of the damage dealt is transferred to the caster's Blood Pool. Casting this spell does not provoke Opportunity Attacks.</p>",
